# Telegram application credentials for the Telegram panel.
#
# Obtain them once with your own Telegram account at https://my.telegram.org.
# They are application credentials, not user secrets, and are embedded at build
# time. Without them the Telegram panel stays offline and reports that this
# build is not configured.
#
# Either export these variables or copy this file to `.env` and fill it in:
# ZZZ_TELEGRAM_API_ID=123456
# ZZZ_TELEGRAM_API_HASH=0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef
